The Job holder is responsible for maintaining a positive corporate image and marketing the University Programmes.
Duties and Responsibilities
Duties and responsibilities at this level will entail: -
Implementing corporate communications policies, strategies and programmes;
Compiling information on articles in the media pertaining to the University;
Implementing media relations and internal communications programmes;
Managing social media platforms;
Organizing corporate functions and events;
Establishing an inventory of press and other organizations contacts;
